      "what": "This study analyzed the risks of implementing Performance-Based Contracting (PBC) for road maintenance in Saudi Arabia using survey data from 93 government, contracting, and consulting professionals. Through Structural Equation Modelling and Spearman's rank correlation, the research evaluated 23 risk factors, identifying weak contractor performance, unexpected traffic growth, skill gaps, infrastructure deterioration, and early contract termination as the top five threats.",
